### CRIT-02: Dual V1/V2 UI Component System — Incomplete Migration with Active Mixed Imports

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Severity** | Critical |
| **Confidence** | Confirmed |
| **Category** | ARC, DUP, STD |

**Re-validation note:** This finding was verified by counting actual files in both directories and by tracing imports across `packages/app/src/`. The numbers are precise, and the mixed imports in 7 files are real.

**Evidence — 18 duplicated component pairs:**

Both versions are exported via `packages/ui/package.json` under parallel paths:
```
"./*": "./src/components/*.tsx"            → v1 components
"./v2/*": "./src/v2/components/*.tsx"     → v2 components
```

The duplicated pairs (same concept, two implementations):

| Component | v1 path | v2 path |
|-----------|---------|---------|
| accordion | `components/accordion.tsx` | `v2/components/accordion-v2.tsx` |
| avatar | `components/avatar.tsx` | `v2/components/avatar-v2.tsx` |
| basic-tool | `components/basic-tool.tsx` | `v2/components/basic-tool-v2.tsx` |
| button | `components/button.tsx` | `v2/components/button-v2.tsx` |
| checkbox | `components/checkbox.tsx` | `v2/components/checkbox-v2.tsx` |
| dialog | `components/dialog.tsx` | `v2/components/dialog-v2.tsx` |
| diff-changes | `components/diff-changes.tsx` | `v2/components/diff-changes-v2.tsx` |
| icon-button | `components/icon-button.tsx` | `v2/components/icon-button-v2.tsx` |
| inline-input | `components/inline-input.tsx` | `v2/components/inline-input-v2.tsx` |
| keybind | `components/keybind.tsx` | `v2/components/keybind-v2.tsx` |
| line-comment | `components/line-comment.tsx` | `v2/components/line-comment-v2.tsx` |
| select | `components/select.tsx` | `v2/components/select-v2.tsx` |
| switch | `components/switch.tsx` | `v2/components/switch-v2.tsx` |
| tabs | `components/tabs.tsx` | `v2/components/tabs-v2.tsx` |
| text-shimmer | `components/text-shimmer.tsx` | `v2/components/text-shimmer-v2.tsx` |
| toast | `components/toast.tsx` | `v2/components/toast-v2.tsx` |
| tool-error-card | `components/tool-error-card.tsx` | `v2/components/tool-error-card-v2.tsx` |
| tooltip | `components/tooltip.tsx` | `v2/components/tooltip-v2.tsx` |

**Evidence — Same files import from BOTH versions simultaneously (7 files):**

| File | v1 imports | v2 imports | Risk |
|------|-----------|-----------|------|
| `app/src/components/session/session-header.tsx` | `button`, `icon-button`, `keybind`, `tooltip` | `icon-button-v2` | **HIGH** — same icon-button family mixed in one view |
| `app/src/components/titlebar.tsx` | `button`, `icon-button`, `tooltip` | `icon-button-v2` | **HIGH** — same icon-button family mixed |
| `app/src/pages/home.tsx` | `button` | `button-v2`, `icon-button-v2` | **HIGH** — same button family mixed |
| `app/src/components/status-popover.tsx` | `button` | `icon-button-v2` | MEDIUM — different component families |
| `app/src/components/windows-app-menu.tsx` | `icon-button` | `icon-button-v2` | **HIGH** — same icon-button family mixed |
| `app/src/components/settings-v2/general.tsx` | `tooltip` | `button-v2`, `select-v2`, `switch-v2` | MEDIUM — different component families |
| `app/src/utils/toast.tsx` | `toast` (legacy) | `toast-v2` | LOW — bridge/wrapper file |

**Evidence — 45 v1-only components have NO v2 counterpart:**
```
animated-number, app-icon, card, collapsible, context-menu,
dock-prompt, dock-surface, dropdown-menu, favicon, file-icon,
file-media, file-search, file-ssr, file, font, hover-card, icon,
image-preview, line-comment-annotations, list, logo, markdown,
message-nav, message-part, motion-spring, popover, progress-circle,
progress, provider-icon, radio-group, resize-handle, scroll-view,
session-retry, session-review, session-turn, spinner,
sticky-accordion-header, tag, text-field, text-reveal,
text-strikethrough, tool-count-label, tool-count-summary,
tool-status-title, typewriter
```

**Evidence — 12 v2-only components with no v1 counterpart:**
```
badge-v2, field-v2, icon (v2-specific), menu-v2, project-avatar-v2,
radio-v2, segmented-control-v2, tab-state-indicator, text-input-v2,
textarea-v2, wordmark-v2, icon (v2 version)
```

**Evidence — Different APIs between versions (incompatible):**

```
v1 Button variant:      "primary" | "secondary" | "ghost"
v2 ButtonV2 variant:    "neutral" | "contrast" | "ghost" | "ghost-muted"

v1 IconButton size:     "small" | "normal" | "large"
v2 IconButtonV2 size:   "small" | "normal" | "large"  (same size enum but different CSS)
```

**Impact:**

1. **Visual design inconsistency** — 4 files (`session-header.tsx`, `titlebar.tsx`, `home.tsx`, `windows-app-menu.tsx`) render both v1 and v2 variants of the same component family side by side in the same view. Users see mismatched buttons, icons, and layout elements.
2. **Doubled maintenance** — every bug fix or enhancement must be applied to both v1 and v2.
3. **No migration plan** — there is no documented strategy for completing the migration, no deprecation schedule for v1, and no criteria for "migration complete."
4. **Onboarding confusion** — new developers don't know which version to use. The existence of `settings-v2/` and `v2/` directories suggests a migration, but the presence of mixed imports in production files suggests the migration is incomplete.

**Recommendation:**

1. Create `packages/ui/MIGRATION.md` listing all component concepts with status (v1-only, v2-only, duplicated).
2. For each of the 18 paired components, decide: keep v1, keep v2, or merge.
3. Remove the losing variant from `packages/ui/package.json` exports.
4. Update all consumers:
   ```bash
   rg "@opencode-ai/ui/(button|dialog|accordion|icon-button|select|switch|tabs|toast|tooltip)\b" packages/app/src/
   # Update each occurrence to the surviving version
   ```
5. **Verification:**
   ```bash
   # After migration, no file should import both versions of the same component:
   rg "@opencode-ai/ui/(button|icon-button)" packages/app/src/components/session/session-header.tsx
   # Should show only one version
   ```

